        },
        {
            "id": "page3",
            "speaker": "lysandre",
            "lines": [
                "Mega Evolution is something I, too, would like to be able to use."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page4');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page4",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "Actually, Lysandre himself is of royal ancestry... He truly is a chosen one."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page5');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page5",
            "speaker": "lysandre",
            "lines": [
                "True. I'm a descendant of the king's younger brother."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page6');"
                    ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page6",
            "speaker": "lysandre",
            "lines": [
                "That being said, that story is 3,000 years old, so it might not be entirely reliable."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page7');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page7",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                {
                    "type": "expression",
                    "expression": "'By the way, ' + q.player.username + '... Do you know where the Holo Caster is made?';"
                }
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page8');"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page8",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "They're made in Lysandre's lab!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page9');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page9",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "Lysandre is a great man."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page10');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page10",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "He supports Trainers and Pokémon research with some of the profit from the Holo Caster."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page11');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page11",
            "speaker": "lysandre",
            "lines": [
                "People can be divided into two groups."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page12');"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page12",
            "speaker": "lysandre",
            "lines": [
                "Those who give... And those who take..."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page13');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page13",
            "speaker": "lysandre",
            "lines": [
                "It's just as how the Kalos region's two Legendary Pokémon gave life and took life."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page14');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page14",
            "speaker": "lysandre",
            "lines": [
                "I want to be the kind of person who gives..."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page15');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page15",
            "speaker": "lysandre",
            "lines": [
                "But in this world, some foolish humans exist who would show their strength by taking what isn't theirs."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page16');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page16",
            "speaker": "lysandre",
            "lines": [
                "They're filth!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page17');"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page17",
            "speaker": "lysandre",
            "lines": [
                "Long, long ago, the king of Kalos sought to take everything for his own, and he created a terrible weapon."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page18');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page18",
            "speaker": "lysandre",
            "lines": [
                "Then the fire of destruction was unleashed..."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page19');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page19",
            "speaker": "lysandre",
            "lines": [
                "That is the legend that has been passed down."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page20');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page20",
            "speaker": "lysandre",
            "lines": [
                "Kalos is beautiful right now!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page21');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page21",
            "speaker": "lysandre",
            "lines": [
                "There will be no foolish actions if the number of people and Pokémon do not increase."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page22');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page22",
            "speaker": "lysandre",
            "lines": [
                "That being said, the future isn't decided."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page23');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page23",
            "speaker": "lysandre",
            "lines": [
                "You can't be sure each day will be like the one before."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page24');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page24",
            "speaker": "lysandre",
            "lines": [
                "What the king of Kalos did was reprehensible, but..."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page25');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page25",
            "speaker": "lysandre",
            "lines": [
                "The ultimate weapon did manage to wash the world clean of that era's filth."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.run_command('give ' + q.player.username + ' cobblemon:kings_rock');",
                            "q.run_command('playsound minecraft:itemget ambient ' + q.player.username + ' ~ ~ ~ 1 1 1');",
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page26');"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page26",
            "speaker": "lysandre",
            "lines": [
                "Thank you for listening. Take that as an apology for my taking up your time."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.run_command('particle cloud -293 121 433 2 2 2 1 100');",
                            "q.run_command('tp @e[x=-293,y=120,z=433,dy=3,type=cobblemon:npc] 10000000 -50000 -10000000');",
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page27');"]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page27",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "What a passionate person. He's just like a blazing flame."
