            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page28');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page28",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "Perhaps his pride in his lineage is what makes him burn so intensely."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page29');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page29",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "That being said, what Lysandre says is only one way of looking at things..."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page30');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page30",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "It's not necessarily the truth."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page31');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page31",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                {
                    "type": "expression",
                    "expression": "'' + q.player.username + '! What is truly important is the time you spend together with others!';"
                }
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page32');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page32",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "Treasure these moments spent traveling the Kalos region with your Pokémon!"
            ],
